"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/%E9%94%85%E5%B7%B4%E8%82%89_Crispy_Fried_Pork_with_Sweet_and_Sour_Sauce_-_Original_Taste.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%94%85%E5%B7%B4%E8%82%89_Crispy_Fried_Pork_with_Sweet_and_Sour_Sauce_-_Original_Taste.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=93302919","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2020-08-19 15:07:36","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"\u9505\u5df4\u8089 Crispy Fried Pork with Sweet and Sour Sauce - Original Taste","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Pork dishes|Flickr images reviewed by FlickreviewR 2","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"This Northern Chinese version of sweet and sour pork was crisper, with only a drizzle of sauce. The name \u9505\u5df4\u8089 Guoba Pork, named after the crusty burnt rice at the bottom of the pot seems a misnomer, but I guess I can see the parallels between the crunchy light batter and the burnt rice.\n<p>---\nDinner with Mei, Peter, Molley, HY, Raymond, Julia and Alpha.\n</p><p>Molley did the ordering, so all we had to do was sit back, and eat!\u00a0:)\n</p><p>Although I did insist on the Chilli Chicken and Mixed Salad. I do like their salads!\n</p><p>About AUD15 per person.\n</p><p>\u6e90\u5473\u9999 \u4e1c\u5317\u83dc\u9986\nOriginal Taste Northern China Cuisine\n930 Whitehorse Rd, Box Hill\nTel: 03 9898 8787\n</p><p>Photos:\n- \u97ed\u83dc\u76d2 Chive and Egg Pastries\n- \u5730\u4e09\u9c9c Three Earthly Delights with \u571f\u8c46 potato, \u8304\u5b50 eggplant / aubergine, \u9752\u6912 Capsicum / green pepper\n- \u9505\u5df4\u8089 Crispy Fried Pork with Sweet and Sour Sauce\n- \u4e71\u5c4f Mixed Salad with \u732a\u76ae\u51bb pig head terrine\n- \u5e72\u9999\u8fa3\u5b50\u9e21 Sichuan Chilli Chicken\n- \u5b5c\u7136\u7f8a\u8089 Cumin Lamb\n- Julia, Peter, Mei\n- Molley and HY\n</p><p>Other dishes we had include: (photos from previous visit)\n- \u732a\u8089\u767d\u83dc\u7096\u62c9\u7c89 Pork, Chinese Cabbage and Bean Noodle Stew\n</p>\n- Stir-Fried French Bean, Pork Mince and Preserved Vegetable","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2008-04-09 19:27:00","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/10559879@N00/2403231552/\">https://www.flickr.com/photos/10559879@N00/2403231552/</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"avlxyz","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-sa-2.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]}}}}